    {
        "text": "Stupid, foolish boy...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grandpa"
    },
    {
        "text": "You didn't have to do this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grandpa"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why would you go so far for a world that owes you so much?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grandpa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sir?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You must leave now! Originium activity is rising rapidly in this area!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_495_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I want to see my grandson one last time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grandpa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#8$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Only a little further, Hibiscus. Distract him...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_495_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Kreide, grandpa's here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grandpa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#4$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "You...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_495_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Kreide, my boy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grandpa"
    },
    {
        "text": "Vent whatever anger you have on me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grandpa"
    },
    {
        "text": "Come to me, before you do any more harm!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grandpa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_495_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've deceived you for so many years... I thought about dying for your sake, but I never thought you would come to an end like this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grandpa"
    },
    {
        "text": "If your choice is to let the others live, why not let me come with you in my last days?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grandpa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_495_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let me join you on your final journey, my boy!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grandpa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.51
    },
    {
        "text": "The crystalline monster no longer understands the old man's words."
    },
    {
        "text": "The flash of lucidity was a fleeting miracle. All the monster can think about now is dragging everything around it into emptiness, dancing to his cello's tune."
    },
    {
        "text": "The monster follows the sound, playing a song of death."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
