    {
        "text": "How?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gertrude"
    },
    {
        "text": "Friendship, dedication, sacrifice\u2014such childish ideals should have been shattered upon contact with reality. How? How?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gertrude"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_484_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's not over yet!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gertrude"
    },
    {
        "text": "Kreide may have forcibly assimilated two verses of the Voice of Mundane, but he could not overcome the disorder and madness of their amalgamation!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gertrude"
    },
    {
        "text": "Kreide's melody has faded, but Ebenholz's Voice lingers. I\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gertrude"
    },
