    },
    {
        "text": "Wait for me... wait for me!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No! It's dangerous. We should call Infected Palliative Services...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#8$2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you saying?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "text": "Kreide won't die!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#8$2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_483_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "*cough*...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kreide"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#4$2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_483_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You're awake, Kreide!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "text": "See? He'll be fine!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#4$2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_483_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Ebenholz...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kreide"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#4$2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_483_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm here, it's me!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#4$2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_483_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't... don't bother. I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kreide"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#6$2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_483_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#6$2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_483_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "(Takes a deep breath)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kreide"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#6$2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_483_1#2$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I feel... so light...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kreide"
    },
    {
        "text": "It hurt so much... but I feel better now...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kreide"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#6$2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_483_1#2$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, you'll get better... yes...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#6$2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_483_1#3$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Listen carefully, Ebenholz. This is the last time I'll be able to talk to you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kreide"
    },
    {
        "text": "Remember my words.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kreide"
    },
    {
        "text": "Live on, Ebenholz, and walk through the long night.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kreide"
    },
    {
        "text": "Fight injustice, and treat others with generosity and charity.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kreide"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#6$2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_483_1#2$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Only by doing so will I live on in your memory.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kreide"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#6$2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_483_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll ask you, how did your day go, Ebenholz?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kreide"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#6$2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_483_1#2$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "And you'll tell me proudly that you had a good and productive day.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kreide"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#6$2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_483_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You'll tell me about the challenges you face while doing good, and complain about how fate is a miser.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kreide"
    },
    {
        "text": "And it will be okay, because I'll be listening.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kreide"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#6$2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_483_1#2$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It's alright to complain a little, when you've worked so hard.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kreide"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#6$2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_483_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Only by doing so will you rise above pain and suffering, and find peace in your heart.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kreide"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#6$2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_483_1#3$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Remember that we've fought together against cruel fate and won.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kreide"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#6$2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_483_1#2$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "When you think of me, laugh. Don't cry.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kreide"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#10$2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_483_1#2$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, yes!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#10$2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_483_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "And Ebenholz... I'm sorry.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kreide"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#10$2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_483_1#2$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I haven't thought about what token... to give you...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kreide"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#10$2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_483_1#2$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Anything's fine. Just don't die... please...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#10$2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_483_1#2$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kreide"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
