    },
    {
        "text": "Pathetic.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Biegler"
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe I acted out of impulse, but dealing with threats to public safety is also part of my job.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Biegler"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_486_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll be sure to mention you in my report, Gr\u00e4fin Strollo.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Biegler"
    },
    {
        "text": "Good night. I hope your dreams don't involve cursing anybody.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Biegler"
    },
