        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#3$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Your hand's bleeding! Did you get scratched by Originium crystals?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#7$2",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#3$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah, yes... I guess there's a bit of blood...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#7$2",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You need treatment immediately\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#4$2",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Treatment? It's Kreide who needs treatment!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#4$2",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Ebenholz, he's...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#4$2",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#6$2",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't say it, Hibiscus. I beg you...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#6$2",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "text": "He... he's Infected, Ebenholz. If you don't want Palliative Services to get involved, at least find a room that's isolated, for his own sake.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#6$2",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I know, I know...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "text": "The lounge at the concert hall.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#6$2",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright, I'll take him there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#6$2",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I will.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "text": "Come, Kreide. I'll carry you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_clothmovement",
        "volume": 0.7
    },
    {
        "text": "Ebenholz lifts Kreide up. The Originium crystals inflict more wounds on him, but he pays them no heed."
    },
    {
        "text": "He carries his friend, even as he feels the body cooling, as though embracing a short but sweet dream."
    },
