        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You're\u2014You're still alive!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll take you to Hibiscus\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#4$2",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "text": "Lay me to rest in this building.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kreide?"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you return to The Afterglow someday, you'll remember that you once had a good friend, with whom you've laughed and argued here...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kreide?"
    },
    {
        "text": "And at the last, put on a duet to remember.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kreide?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#8$2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "No. You're not Kreide. You're\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#8$2",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "text": "Isn't this what you wanted?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kreide?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#8$2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Shut your mouth. I won't allow you to defile his memory.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "text": "Kreide gave his life to cleanse the Voice of Mundane, but it's still in my head?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#10$2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#8$2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I warn you... don't think I'll hesitate to blow my own head off, if you dare imitate him one more time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#8$2",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "text": "(Sighs)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Voice in His Head"
    },
    {
        "text": "My foolish bloodline.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Voice in His Head"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#9$2"
    },
